+## Sales (schema 3)
+
+- Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 by adding an empty `sales` collection.
+- Each sale row stores `ticket`, normalized UTC `soldAt`, `dishId`, `qty`,
+  and an `ingredients` snapshot of scaled recipe quantities. Recipe edits
+  cannot change historical theoretical usage.
+- Tickets identify imports globally. A file commits sales, stock and ledger
+  together, or changes nothing. Sale consumption uses `sale:<ticket>` as ref
+  and the sale instant as the movement time.
